e Licenses, Elections, Vital Records, Wetland Permits, and Telephone Pole Licenses.  Please note that dump stickers are no longer available at the office, and must be obtained directly from BCEP.  The Town Clerk is an elected position, with a three year term.  \nNews & Announcements: \ncontent \nFrequently Asked Questions About Registration: \nPosts \ncontent \nResources: \nResources \nStaff Contacts:              \r\n1598 Dover Road, Epsom, NH 03234 \n6037369002  |  selectboard.admin@epsomnh.gov \nPowered By  Munibit  | © 2026 Terms  |  Privacy  |  Notifications  |  Accessibility Login                  \r\nSection Tools \r\nHello  \r\nWhat is a Passkey? \n                Imagine signing into your account as easily as unlocking your phone—no more worrying about remembering or typing a password. A passkey is a secure digital key that uses the safety features in your device to keep your account protected. It’s designed to be both simple to use and highly secure. \n                Ready to experience a simpler, safer sign-in? Click the button above to create your passkey now. \r\nSign Up for Notifications! \r\n             Do not show again \r\nFill out the following fields. \n                     Activate notifications by clicking or tapping on the verification messages we send. Completing the verification process confirms your consent. Notification categories can be edited later from an email message footer. \r\n ",
